344.30712890625, 68.22145080566406], "widgets_values": ["video-pros/indextts25_emotion"], "inputs": [{"name": "audio", "link": 4, "label": "audio", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "audio"}, {"widget": {"name": "filename_prefix"}, "name": "filename_prefix", "label": "filename_prefix", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "filename_prefix"}, {"widget": {"name": "audioUI"}, "name": "audioUI", "label": "audioUI", "type": "AUDIO_UI", "localized_name": "audioUI"}], "flags": {}, "id": 5, "type": "SaveAudio", "title": "输出音频", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.1.0", "widget_ue_connectable": {"filename_prefix": true}, "Node name for S&R": "SaveAudio"}, "order": 9}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["# IndexTTS 2.5 情感文本控制 · 使用说明\n\n## 输入\n- 音色参考音频：5~15 秒干净人声（无背景音乐/多人/喷麦），越干净克隆还原度越高\n- 配音台词：要朗读的文本，长文本自动分段\n- 情感描述文本：用自然语言描述语气，例：\"语气低沉，语速极慢，字字千钧，句尾下沉\"\n- 情感强度：0~1，官方建议情感文本模式 **0.6 左右更自然**（1.0 情绪最饱满但容易用力过猛）\n\n## 采样参数（默认已调优）\n- temperature 0.7 / top_p 0.85 / repetition_penalty 1.1：音色稳定、措辞自然\n- 分段：每段 ≤120 字，段间 350ms 静音；max_mel_tokens 3000\n\n## 情感描述写法示例\n- 帝王压迫：\"语气低沉，语速极慢，字字千钧，句尾下沉，带着不容置疑的威严\"\n- 温柔：\"语气温柔，语速平缓，带着欣慰的笑意\"\n- 愤怒：\"语气急促，声音提高，带着压抑的怒气\"\n\n## 其他\n- 语言：默认 ZH（支持 EN/JA/ES/AR）；语速 duration_factor 0.5~2.0\n- 种子：固定可复现，randomize 每次随机\n- 输出：SaveAudio 节点，默认 video-pros/indextts25_emotion"], "inputs": [], "flags": {"pinned": true}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [560, 520], "pos": [-655.0236206054688, -21.32022476196289], "id": 10, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"}, "order": 5}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "AUDIO", "links": [2], "label": "AUDIO", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "AUDIO"}], "size": [330, 136], "pos": [7.589037895202637, 397.67694091796875], "widgets_values": ["442adfa10cc1c11ebea148c83b59f4e05661434e12d9220d4857fcc09f4efad7.mp3", null, null], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "audio"}, "name": "audio", "label": "audio", "type": "COMBO", "localized_na